00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.230
When we meet again in the future...

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.400
When we meet again in the future...

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:49.870
We are gonna get married!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:49.870
We shall duel!

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:52.820
Note: "Kettou" means "to duel", and "kekkon" means "to marry"...

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.800
