00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.750
Oh! You finally remembered!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:03.120
So you've come to fulfill our childhood promise to duel, huh?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.310
Eh?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.050
