00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:09.870
Now prepare to fight!

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.410
Noooo...

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:17.220
Shouryuu Retten Shou!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.020
Your move is as great as ever, Momoko-dono!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.340
Not at all.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.480
Why did you blast him away!?

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:29.370
We didn't find out anything about the twelve shinshou war!

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:32.040
What?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:33.700
Another assassin?

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:34.740
Yeah...

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.100
