00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.330
Everything? About what?

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.840
The twelve shinshou war,

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.830
and you two's future.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:51.330
Ever since pre-historical Japan,

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:57.520
there existed twelve martial artist families who practice different styles of martial arts.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:02.160
They were united under one leadership at the beginning, but one day...

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.100
East

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.100
West

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:05.100
They were divided into two branches.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.260
The martial artists from both branches fought each others numerous times.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:16.130
Note: These are six historical battles in Japanese history.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:13.800
Among them, six major battles have changed history.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.640
That's the twelve shinshou war.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:17.800
Are you serious?

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:22.800
The hostility between the west and the east continues to this day!

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:27.030
So in other words, it's a battle between martial artists at a domestic scale?

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.740
Then what's the big deal about it?

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:31.960
You fool!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.570
Don't underestimate the situation!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.980
The population of the martial artists is numbered at hundreds of thousands.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:41.970
Not only that, among them are people involved in politics, entertainment, mass media, and sports.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:46.380
And even in gangs and criminal organizations.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:51.000
If those martial artists re-start the aggression,

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.980
this country would sink under the blaze of war.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.870
Am I also involved in this incident?

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:02.450
That's right.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:03.500
Listen carefully.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:06.210
The head of the western branch is the Kuzuryuu family.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:09.060
And the head of the eastern branch is the Inuzuka family.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:14.390
The two branches have been in a cold war for years, and are on the brink of a full scale war.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:21.110
At this rate, the seventh great war of the twelve shinshou of Japan would start.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.130
There is only one way to avoid it.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:30.040
That is to unite the Kuzuryuu family and the Inuzuka family, the heads of the two branches.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:33.390
In other words, you two's marriage!

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:39.510
However, there are those from the western branch who opposed to make peace.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:43.880
In order to prevent the marriage, to kill Koushi.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:47.130
They will send more assassins in the future.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.550
I had no idea...

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:52.020
...that I was involved in all this...

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:53.380
I...

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.880
Many martial artists will be after my life from now on...

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.210
Rest assured, father.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.170
No matter what kind of assassins they send.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:08.350
Nothing will sway my determination to be with Koushi-dono!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:10.840
Koushi-dono.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.650
Please don't look like that.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:20.430
If we combine our strength, I'm sure we can overcome any hardship like we did today...

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:27.740
No matter what happens from now on, I will always be with you.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.590
Huh? Where is the old man?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:48.790
Father said he has something to take care of, and left.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:49.920
