00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.180
I guess there is no choice.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.140
I'll have to borrow hers.

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:37.920
This shampoo...

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.680
