00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.650
It's not troubling at all!

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:25.230
Eh?

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.650
Don't worry about it.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.190
