00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:37.950
About earlier...

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:38.890
Eh?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:42.120
I too should apologize.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:46.680
The one who's suitable for Inuzuka-kun is Momoko-chan.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:52.170
I'm sure you prefer to be with Momoko-chan than being with me.

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:55.880
That's not true.

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:58.290
Being with her is nothing but trouble...

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.710
She...

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:02.940
She...

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:04.980
I...

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:12.080
Hey, you two.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:15.090
You two sure get along, honors students.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.910
You guys...

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.050
Hey, give us your money.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:22.500
Being persistent will only hurt yourself.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.820
What are you guys doing!?

00:15:25.260 --> 00:15:26.490
"What"?

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.490
You know.

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.440
We are ascertaining our friendship.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:31.510
That's right.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:34.520
Your friends are asking you to lend them money.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:36.820
But this is bad.

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:40.770
Now that the honors students have seen this, they might tell someone.

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:42.690
It's alright.

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:49.000
Inuzuka is the kind of wimp who would do our homework with a little threat.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:52.950
Right? I-nu-zu-ka-kun?

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:57.410
You've stopped asking me to help you with your homework.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:00.300
So are you able to do them yourselves now?

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:04.040
Don't get too cocky, you bastard.

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.450
Momoko-dono!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.370
Are you shopping?

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.250
You too?

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:17.380
Yeah.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:21.620
One person can buy one bag of these at half price today.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.970
Uh... Where is Koushi onii-chan?

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.330
He's not here.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.650
I see...

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:28.930
Too bad...

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:30.720
Sis!

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:36.590
If we don't hurry, we won't make it to the special service of 8 eggs for ¥18 at the supermarket!

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.700
I'm coming right away!

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:42.120
Momoko-dono, excuse us!

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.180
I'll take this one.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:53.420
The dragon girl saved you the last time.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.370
She's not here today.

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:57.130
What are you gonna do, honors student?

00:16:58.410 --> 00:16:59.100
He's right...

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:00.390
What do I do...?

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.460
Hey, what's wrong?

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.320
Standing there speechless.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.860
Hey, are you sure you don't wanna stop us?

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:10.630
Or are you thinking of telling the teacher later on?

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:13.070
You better not tell anyone.

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:16.430
If you did, this would happen!

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:17.630
No violence!

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:20.420
Class rep!

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:21.740
Hey, hey.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.660
You shouldn't hit a girl.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.510
Wh... Who cares!

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:27.270
A cocky bitch like that!

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:29.120
You guys!

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.530
To a girl...!

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.940
Inuzuka-kun.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.040
Let's leave.

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:34.900
I'm alright.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:35.490
OK?

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:36.500
Let's go.

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:38.730
Class rep...

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.810
Make sure to tell someone if you wanna get hit again.

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:46.230
These guys...

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.270
Class rep...

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:50.810
It's frustrating...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:55.550
It's frustrating, but the body is frozen in fear.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:57.280
I know...

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.730
I know that better than anyone.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.050
Even now...

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:06.390
Inuzuka-kun...

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.700
Let's go!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:08.930
There is nothing we can do...

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:10.340
There is nothing we can do!

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:11.350
I know...

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:13.230
That's exactly what I have thought.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:18.850
There is another quiz tomorrow, we have to go home and study, OK?

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:20.540
I was the same.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:22.710
Trying my best to come up with an excuse.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:26.700
Besides, you are going to become a prosecutor in the future, Inuzuka-kun.

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:27.730
That's right.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:29.680
I thought about the same thing.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.160
In the future...

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.200
You are going to punish bigger criminals.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.270
The same thing...

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:36.780
The same...

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:38.470
That's right.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:40.480
This is exactly...

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:44.750
In the future, you are going to punish bigger criminals...

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:48.580
<i>I don't have to bother myself with trivial matters like that.</i>

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.590
I... Inuzuka-kun...

00:18:57.180 --> 00:19:00.230
Class rep, you have to treat your injury.

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:03.090
Don't worry about me.

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:04.590
Go.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:10.530
Inuzuka.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.570
You can run too.

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:15.300
Shove that up your ass.

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:17.560
Run from you dirt bags?

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.910
I would be so embarrassed that I wouldn't be able to show myself on the street anymore.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.140
Wha...!?

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:22.870
You bastard!

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:26.480
You are just a wimp who can hardly talk with a little threat!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:27.570
He's right.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:31.000
I wouldn't do this a while ago.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:35.020
We'll tear you apart.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.120
Ever heard of a revenge?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.540
You bastard!

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:53.410
I guess the world is not a simple place where you can win with determination alone.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:56.180
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.870
Oh. Don't worry about it.

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.650
